     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Hopping Pod is a line of five round pods on single posts, stepping up and down in height along the row, in green, mustard, navy, yellow and red. Children step or hop from pod to pod, judging distance and height each time, which trains balance, leg strength and timing. The product area is only 7' x 1', with a safe play area of 12' x 6'. It fits along a path edge, beside a sandpit or between bigger pieces in a play area. Parents and teachers often turn it into a counting game, with each hop called out loud. Colour is listed as Multi Color. We give 3 years of warranty on galvanised pipe, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope. Ask us to place it on your layout drawing."
     }
    ]
   }
